    {
      "text": "Server Message Block (SMB) banners are used to advertise an SMB service running on a network decoy. You can associate SMB banners with network decoys that have the Shares service enabled. Zscaler Deception provides a list of preconfigured SMB banners that emulate SMB services running on different operating systems and devices. You can also create custom SMB banners based on your business requirements. To learn how to use SMB banners in network decoys, see Configuring Services on a Network Decoy."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Creating an SMB Banner",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To create an SMB banner:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Miragemaker > Miscellaneous > SMB Banners.",
